# baseline does not move for either: both items shipped with Ockham #197 in the
# 0.16.0 line, and the 0.18.0 entry above records core extending
# `converted_neurons` to name the zero-edge `HYPOTv2 -> ABSOLUTE` rewrite as
# well, so the recorded 0.18.0 already covers every core release that carries
